cielos, sobre las bestias, sobre toda la tierra y sobre todo animal que se arrastra sobre la tierra.", "words": [[0, 210030], [2, 210157], [7, 210417], [13, 211341], [21, 211787], [24, 212027], [31, 212267], [33, 212407], [41, 212567], [49, 213167], [58, 214067], [60, 214087], [68, 214247], [79, 215816], [81, 215954], [88, 216394], [94, 216654], [98, 216834], [104, 217234], [108, 217394], [113, 218134], [119, 218334], [123, 218534], [128, 218874], [131, 218994], [135, 219094], [143, 219874], [149, 220034], [153, 220254], [162, 221054], [168, 221234], [173, 221514], [176, 221694], [183, 222034], [185, 222514], [191, 222754], [196, 223034], [203, 223394], [207, 223694], [210, 223834], [219, 224314], [225, 224514], [228, 224734]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 225848, "end": 233011, "text": "Y creó Dios al hombre a su imagen, a imagen de Dios lo creó; varón y hembra los creó.", "words": [[0, 225848], [2, 225995], [7, 226435], [12, 226595], [15, 227055], [22, 227355], [24, 227555], [27, 227675], [35, 228615], [37, 228715], [44, 229075], [47, 229435], [52, 229715], [55, 229995], [61, 231123], [67, 231413], [69, 231893], [76, 232287], [80, 232680]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 233461, "end": 250009, "text": "Y los bendijo Dios; y les dijo Dios: Fructificad y multiplicaos, y llenad la tierra, y sojuzgadla, y dominad sobre los peces del mar, y sobre las aves de los cielos, y sobre todas las bestias que se mueven sobre la tierra.", "words": [[0, 233461], [2, 233566], [6, 233706], [14, 234206], [20, 235219], [22, 235339], [26, 235459], [31, 235719], [37, 236570], [49, 237539], [51, 237719], [65, 238899], [67, 239179], [74, 239579], [77, 239719], [85, 240679], [87, 240779], [99, 242019], [101, 242099], [109, 242679], [115, 242899], [119, 243099], [125, 243459], [129, 243659], [134, 243939], [136, 244379], [142, 244579], [146, 244799], [151, 245159], [154, 245279], [158, 245399], [166, 246607], [168, 246711], [174, 246891], [180, 247231], [184, 247531], [192, 248051], [196, 248231], [199